        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add retry-stable immutable receipt chains for repair queues, plans, post-flight states, failures, CrabFleet sessions, issue status comments, dashboard delivery, cluster results, aggregate reports, and finalizer publications\n- receipt external status mutations only after success, keep business idempotency stable across workflow attempts, and flush projection failures without dropping the primary error\n- keep credential-isolated cluster and mutation jobs state-token-free by uploading immutable shards to one state-authorized collector; existing result/finalizer publishers import their own shards directly\n- make the shared repair action-ledger finalizer operation-family agnostic and document the six-family model\n\n## Validation\n\n- direct main and repair TypeScript builds\n- repair/action-ledger focused suites: 27 passed\n- broader ClawSweeper workflow/security suites: 106 passed\n- lint and formatting checks on all touched source, tests, docs, and workflows\n- `git diff --check`\n- repo-wide `pnpm run check` reached 1,082 passes with zero test failures before this lane was intentionally stopped after detecting concurrent heavy checks in other sessions\n\n## Stack\n\n- depends on https://github.com/openclaw/clawsweeper/pull/520 for command receipts and the shared action-ledger CLI\n- transitively depends on https://github.com/openclaw/clawsweeper/pull/512 for the immutable runtime and review/apply receipts\n- will be rebased and retargeted to `main` after those dependencies land",
